msgstr "@calamus_heh ここにしばらく住んでると、\nがれきに慣れてくるんだよ。"

msgid "@calamus_smile Come on, our house isn't far from here."
msgstr "@calamus_smile ほら行こう、家はもうすぐだよ。"

msgid "@calamus Oh, Niko, did you come by for a visit?\\>\\n\\@calamus_smile Our house is up here, please follow me."
msgstr "@calamus あっ、ニコ、会いに来てくれたのか？\\>\\n\\@calamus_smile オレらの家はこの先にある、ついてきな。"

